  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>A 3-star hotel right in the centre of Menton, steps away from the beaches, the casino and the Biovès gardens. A practical base for exploring the easternmost town of the French Riviera, right by the Italian border.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you book</h2>
      <p>Pets are welcome except in the restaurant dining room, but the amount of any surcharge remains unclear: some sources (customer reviews) mention no charge at all, while another mentions 15€. Neither version is officially confirmed with certainty. Remember to mention your dog when booking and ask for the exact rate — reconfirm by phone before booking, especially if you're travelling with a large dog.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: the Garavan dog beach, the only Menton beach allowed for dogs, is at the other end of town — plan for a walk or a short drive.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Menton's old town and covered market are within walking distance, as are the harbour and the gardens along the seafront.</p>
